  "details": "In local world testing, avatars from other profiles (other accounts) fail to load and are displayed as the error robot avatar.\n\nOnly my own avatar is shown correctly, which prevents proper inStation testing.\n\nThe nameplate for these avatars shows “Security Check Failed.”\n\nThis issue appears to be a recurrence of the following previously reported problems:\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/avatar-loading-always-fails-in-build-test-clients\n\nhttps://ask.vrchat.com/t/cant-use-my-avatar-in-local-test-world/42527",
